{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45077","headline":"奉同颜使君真卿开元寺经藏院会观树文殊碑 · 皎然","name":"奉同颜使君真卿开元寺经藏院会观树文殊碑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万国布殊私，千年降祖师。\n雁门传法至，龙藏立言时。\n故实刊周典，新声播鲁诗。\n六铢那更拂，劫石尽无期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}